tle samba, Built upon a single note,W: other notes are bound  to follow, but the root is still that note.W: Now this new one is the consequence of the one we've just been through,W: as I'm bound to be the unavoidable consequence of you.W:W: There's so many people who can talk and talk and talk and just say nothing, or nearly nothing.W: I have used up all the scale I know, and at the end I've come to  nothing, or nearly nothing.W:W: So I came back to my first note, as I must come back to you.W: I will pour into that one note all the love I feel for you.W: Any one who wants the whole show, Re mi fa sol la si do,W: he will find himself with no show, Better play the note you know.